# OACS Project Policy

This repository uses project-scoped OACS memory. Use the globally installed
`oacs` Skill for substantial work and `proof-loop` when current proof against
explicit acceptance criteria is required. Current user instructions override
stale checkpoints and historical memory. Keep OACS databases, keys,
passphrases, and private agent state out of Git.
